Introduce opaque GTK4 key events and the GtkAdjustment scrollbar boundary.
Wire wxScrolledWindow virtual extent to wxPizza natural measurement.
Origin: EmberBSD (AI-assisted), wxWindows licence.
This is an integration draft: the remaining window/controller port and actual
GTK4 compilation/runtime acceptance are not complete.

